### Contoh

Isi `App.java`:

```java
package com.bisangoding.todolist;

import java.util.Scanner;

public class App {
    public static void main(String[] args) {
        TodoService service = new TodoService(new TodoRepositoryFile("todo.csv"));
        new TodoView(service).jalankan(new Scanner(System.in));
    }
}
```

Membangun dan menjalankan:

```bash
mvn clean package
java -cp target/todolist-1.0-SNAPSHOT.jar com.bisangoding.todolist.App
```

Aplikasi berjalan di terminal seperti di materi Proyek Todolist OOP, dan `todo.csv` dibuat di folder tempat perintah `java` diketik.
